# America: History and Life Online: History and Much More.

**Authors:** Falk, Joyce Duncan

## Abstract
This guide to searching for "America: History and Life," a bibliographic database offering resources on topics in social sciences, humanities, and arts in the United States and Canada, covers subject scope, selection and coverage, document types and records, combined entries, subject indexing, personal names, geographic names, historical periods, and search techniques. (EJS)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ282995

